# Team slugs:  https://github.com/orgs/AMD-AGI/teams
# Syntax:      https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Rules
# - Last matching rule wins; order is general -> specific.
# - Prefer GitHub Teams over individuals.
# - All paths currently require @AMD-AGI/SaFE approval. The explicitly
#   listed paths below are the high-risk surface (CI/CD, packaging,
#   secret-pinned dependencies, deployment, agent runtimes); they are
#   enumerated so that future stratification (e.g. introducing a
#   SAFE-leads sub-team) only needs to swap the right-hand owner without
#   re-discovering the path list.
#
# Default - every file requires project-team approval
*                                                              @AMD-AGI/SaFE

